    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That sounds... almost peaceful in a weird way. Like i wouldn't have to fight to feel anything anymore. But it feels more like i'm just waiting for something to happen, even though i know nothing will. It's like i'm just stuck in this waiting room between being a person and being nothing. Does that even make sense?",
